-- Elwynn Forest review (starter zones pass, 2026-11-16)
-- Reference: TDB 8.3.7 (TrinityCore full world DB for this client build). TC 9.2.7 to 12.1.0 have the same Elwynn spawns.
-- 1) Elwynn had about twice the TDB creature count for most mobs and critters (two overlapping spawn sets).
--    Each TDB spawn keeps its nearest match of ours; unmatched extras are removed down to the TDB count.
--    Never removed: critters and wild battle pets (pet battles thread owns those), fireworks, rares/elites, NPCs with menus, friendly NPCs, holiday spawns, pathed,
--    pooled, linked or scripted spawns. Exact doubles and repeated named NPCs are removed too.
-- 2) Stormwind Royal Guard: 15 static guards standing in blobs on the road (snapshots of the patrol) are
--    replaced by TDB's mounted 9-guard patrol from the Stormwind gate to Eastvale (despawns at the end, respawns at the gate).
-- 3) Hallow's End (Goldshire Wickerman), Midsummer, Noblegarden and Lunar Festival pieces that showed all year are linked to their events.

-- 1) extra spawns (634)
